sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Runtime
    participant API as MES Action Gateway
    participant Auth as Policy/Approval
    participant DB as Factory DB
    Agent->>API: actionId, payload, requestId
    API->>Auth: 授权/审批/资源版本
    Auth-->>API: 许可或拒绝
    API->>DB: 同事务业务/幂等/审计/Outbox
    alt 提交确认
        DB-->>API: COMMITTED
    else 结果不确定
        DB-->>API: UNKNOWN
        API->>DB: 按 requestId 核查
    end
    API-->>Agent: 状态与关联 ID
